#: src/type-stub.md:1
msgid "Type stub generation (`*.pyi` files) and introspection"
msgstr "型別 stub 產生（`*.pyi` 檔案）與內省"

#: src/type-stub.md:3
msgid ""
"_This feature is still in active development._ _See [the related issue]"
"(https://github.com/PyO3/pyo3/issues/5137)._"
msgstr ""

#: src/type-stub.md:6
msgid ""
"_For documentation on type stubs and how to use them with stable PyO3, refer "
"to [this page](python-typing-hints.md)_"
msgstr ""
"_如需型別 stub 文件與在穩定版 PyO3 中的使用方式，請參考[此頁](python-typing-"
"hints.md)_"

#: src/type-stub.md:8
msgid ""
"PyO3 has a work in progress support to generate [type stub files](https://"
"typing.python.org/en/latest/spec/distributing.html#stub-files)."
msgstr ""
"PyO3 正在開發產生[型別 stub 檔案](https://typing.python.org/en/latest/spec/"
"distributing.html#stub-files)的支援。"

#: src/type-stub.md:10
msgid "It works using:"
msgstr "其運作方式如下："

#: src/type-stub.md:12
msgid ""
"PyO3 macros (`#[pyclass]`) that generate constant JSON strings that are then "
"included in the built binaries by rustc if the `experimental-inspect` "
"feature is enabled."
msgstr ""
"PyO3 巨集（`#[pyclass]`）會產生固定的 JSON 字串，並在啟用 `experimental-"
"inspect` 功能時由 rustc 內嵌到編譯出的二進位檔。"

#: src/type-stub.md:13
msgid ""
"The `pyo3-introspection` crate that can parse the generated binaries, "
"extract the JSON strings and build stub files from it."
msgstr ""
"`pyo3-introspection` 軟體箱可解析產生的二進位檔，抽取 JSON 字串並產生 stub 檔"
"案。"

#: src/type-stub.md:14
msgid ""
"Build tools like `maturin` exposing options in their CLI API to generate the "
"stubs file."
msgstr ""

#: src/type-stub.md:16
msgid "For example, the following Rust code"
msgstr "例如，以下 Rust 程式碼"

#: src/type-stub.md:24 src/type-stub.md:58
msgid "\"FOO\""
msgstr ""

#: src/type-stub.md:46 src/type-stub.md:69
msgid "\"list[int]\""
msgstr ""

#: src/type-stub.md:53
msgid "will generate the following stub file:"
msgstr "會產生以下 stub 檔案："

#: src/type-stub.md:72
msgid ""
"The only piece of new syntax is that the `#[pyo3(signature = ...)]` "
"attribute can contain type annotations like `#[pyo3(signature = (arg: "
"\"list[int]\") -> \"list[int]\")]` (note the `\"\"` around type "
"annotations). This is useful when PyO3 is not able to derive proper type "
"annotations by itself."
msgstr ""

#: src/type-stub.md:75
msgid ""
"To generate stubs file with `maturin` you can use `maturin generate-stubs --"
"output stubs` that will build the project then generate the stubs in the "
"`stubs` directory. You can also directly integrate the stubs in the built "
"[wheels](glossary.md#wheel) by doing `maturin build --generate-stubs` (works "
"also with `maturin develop`)."
msgstr ""

#: src/type-stub.md:78
msgid ""
"PyO3 also provides the smaller `pyo3-introspection` binary that allows to "
"generate stubs from an existing built extension using something like `pyo3-"
"introspection my_module_binary.so my_module_name output` to introspect the "
"`my_module_binary.so` dynamic library for the `my_module_name` Python module "
"and generate its stubs in the `output` directory."
msgstr ""

#: src/type-stub.md:80
msgid "Constraints and limitations"
msgstr "約束與限制"

#: src/type-stub.md:82
msgid ""
"The `experimental-inspect` feature is required to generate the introspection "
"fragments."
msgstr "需要啟用 `experimental-inspect` 功能才能產生內省片段。"

#: src/type-stub.md:83
msgid ""
"Lots of features are not implemented yet. See [the related issue](https://"
"github.com/PyO3/pyo3/issues/5137) for a list of them."
msgstr ""
"許多功能尚未實作。清單請參考[相關議題](https://github.com/PyO3/pyo3/"
"issues/5137)。"

#: src/type-stub.md:85
msgid ""
"Introspection only works with Python modules declared with an inline Rust "
"module. Modules declared using a function are not supported."
msgstr ""
"內省僅適用於以內嵌 Rust 模組宣告的 Python 模組，使用函式宣告的模組不受支援。"

#: src/type-stub.md:87
msgid ""
"`FromPyObject::INPUT_TYPE` and `IntoPyObject::OUTPUT_TYPE` must be "
"implemented for PyO3 to get the proper input/output type annotations to use."
msgstr ""
"必須實作 `FromPyObject::INPUT_TYPE` 與 `IntoPyObject::OUTPUT_TYPE`，PyO3 才能"
"取得正確的輸入／輸出型別標註。"

#: src/type-stub.md:88
msgid ""
"PyO3 is not able to introspect the content of `#[pymodule]` and "
"`#[pymodule_init]` functions. If they are present, the module is tagged as "
"incomplete using a fake `def __getattr__(name: str) -> Incomplete: ...` "
"function [following best practices](https://typing.python.org/en/latest/"
"guides/writing_stubs.html#incomplete-stubs)."
msgstr ""
"PyO3 無法內省 `#[pymodule]` 與 `#[pymodule_init]` 函式的內容。若存在這些函"
"式，模組會用一個假的 `def __getattr__(name: str) -> Incomplete: ...` 函式標記"
"為 incomplete（遵循[最佳實務](https://typing.python.org/en/latest/guides/"
"writing_stubs.html#incomplete-stubs)）。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\\[Not done yet\\] Build tools like `maturin` exposing `pyo3-"
#~ "introspection` features in their CLI API."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\\[尚未完成\\] 例如 `maturin` 等建置工具在其 CLI API 中暴露 `pyo3-"
#~ "introspection` 功能。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The only piece of added syntax is that the `#[pyo3(signature = ...)]` "
#~ "attribute can now contain type annotations like `#[pyo3(signature = (arg: "
#~ "\"list[int]\") -> \"list[int]\")]` (note the `\"\"` around type "
#~ "annotations). This is useful when PyO3 is not able to derive proper type "
#~ "annotations by itself."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "新增的語法只有一項：`#[pyo3(signature = ...)]` 屬性現在可以包含型別標註，"
#~ "例如 `#[pyo3(signature = (arg: \"list[int]\") -> \"list[int]\")]`（注意型"
#~ "別標註外層的 `\"\"`）。當 PyO3 無法自行推導適當的型別標註時，這會很有用。"
